--- cli ---
     1	"""V2 post-hoc replay outcome miner CLI.
     2	
     3	Each invocation:
     4	
     5	1. Appends the current ``v2:market:prices:{symbol}`` snapshot into the
     6	   per-symbol price-timeline JSONL on disk.
     7	2. Harvests paper evidence rows from ``v2:paper:ledger``,
     8	   ``v2:paper:intents``, and ``v2:paper:intents_held_by_paper_fill_gate``
     9	   and merges them into the replay-bundles JSONL store (dedup by
    10	   intent_id).
    11	3. Fills any outcome window (1m / 5m / 15m / 1h) whose endpoint now has
    12	   a price timeline point.
    13	4. Re-classifies the bundle's label objectively from the realized
    14	   after-cost outcome plus the paper gate decision.
    15	5. Feeds the mined bundles into the existing V2 native edge-proof
    16	   evaluator and writes the refreshed metrics summary and operator
    17	   dashboard payload.
    18	
    19	Safety: read-only with respect to Redis (only ``v2:*``), the exchange,
    20	and the legacy bot tree. Writes JSONL state under
    21	``claude_worklog/final_readiness/v2_post_hoc_replay_outcome_miner/state/``
    22	and JSON status / dashboard payloads under the corresponding
    23	``latest/`` directories.
    24	"""
